      "notes": [
        "Compute all metrics on each model’s own archived grid with its own `areacello`; regrid to a regular longitude-latitude grid only for Figure 1 maps and, if needed for common-frame display, state the `regrid_horizontal` method because regridded pattern statistics depend on method.",
        "For Figure 1, regridding is for visualization only; do not use regridded fields for area means or other summary numbers that belong on the source grid."
